graph TD
    accTitle: Open Clinical Query Filtering Workflow
    accDescr: Flowchart showing get_open_queries iterating over queries and inspecting the latest comment closed flag to return open queries
    A[get_open_queries] --> B[queries.list]
    B --> C{Iterate Queries}
    C --> D{Check latest comment}
    D -- closed=False --> E[Add to Open list]
    D -- closed=True --> F[Skip]
    E --> G[Return open queries]
